{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21733","headline":"郡务稍简因得整比旧诗幷连缀焚削封章委箧仅逾百轴偶成自叹因寄乐天 · 元稹","name":"郡务稍简因得整比旧诗幷连缀焚削封章委箧仅逾百轴偶成自叹因寄乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近来章奏小年诗，一种成空尽可悲。\n书得眼昏朱似碧，用来心破发如丝。\n催身易老缘多事，报主深恩在几时。\n天遣两家无嗣子，欲将文集与它谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}